{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟近日宣佈，將於2027年1月起，把Microsoft Copilot應用中的內置Edge瀏覽器瀏覽體驗設為企業用户的默認功能。這一變化將同時覆蓋Windows和Mac平台的Copilot應用，但IT管理員仍可自行管理或關閉該能力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587268.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.499864+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:34:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.226288+00:00","content_hash":"5f989e4b69a787b73319c7f71a96b857379c236a6d1c135dc25fff145ae629bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}